WEBVTT

00:00:30.151 --> 00:00:33.863
Today I want to talk to you
about Indigenous perspective,

00:00:33.863 --> 00:00:37.617
what that means and how it can help
change this world.

00:00:39.327 --> 00:00:41.245
So I come from Suriname,

00:00:41.287 --> 00:00:44.499
the only Dutch-speaking country
in South America.

00:00:44.999 --> 00:00:49.128
It is also known as the greenest
country in the world right now.

00:00:49.921 --> 00:00:51.756
You didn't know this now, did you?

00:00:51.798 --> 00:00:53.174
(Laughter)

00:00:53.216 --> 00:00:57.470
Suriname is still 93 percent
pristine forests,

00:00:57.512 --> 00:01:01.099
with a population
less than 600,000 people.